<h1>KineGrant ODRL Profile — <code>kgp-v0.2</code></h1>
<p>This URI is the stable profile identity used by KineGrant's ODRL mapping
(<code>https://kinegrant.com/profiles/odrl/kgp-v0.2</code>).</p>
<p>The normative mapping, semantics, example, and test plan live in the
protocol repository: <a href="https://github.com/zoahdev/kinegrant-protocol/blob/main/docs/rfcs/0002-odrl-kgp-profile.md">KGP-RFC-0002</a>
and <a href="https://github.com/zoahdev/kinegrant-protocol/blob/main/spec/ODRL-PROFILE.md">spec/ODRL-PROFILE.md</a>.</p>
<p>KineGrant is an experimental open draft; this profile is not a W3C
standard.</p>
